---
// Icons: DiagramIcon from diagram-icons.ts. Motion: fig-motion.css classes (fm-*).
// Real run: both channels always ready, 1000 selects, a won 484 and b won 516 (Go 1.27.1).
// Bar length is proportional to the wins.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 300;
const SCALE = 0.5;
const rows = [
  { label: 'case <-a', n: 484, y: 150 },
  { label: 'case <-b', n: 516, y: 200 },
];
---
<figure class="gp20b">
  <div class="gp20b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two channels a and b both hold a value, and a select waits on both. Over 1000 runs, case a was chosen 484 times and case b 516 times, so Go chose between ready cases at random.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two ready channels, one select, 1000 runs</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai channel đã sẵn sàng, một select, 1000 lần chạy</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="48" width="180" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="chan-in" x={40} y={68} size={26} />
    <text x="62" y="73" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>channel a: has "a"</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>channel a: có "a"</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="20" y="98" width="180" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="chan-in" x={40} y={118} size={26} />
    <text x="62" y="123" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>channel b: has "b"</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>channel b: có "b"</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="200" x2="238" y1="68" y2="96" class="ln fm-flow" />
    <line x1="200" x2="238" y1="118" y2="104" class="ln fm-flow" />
    <polygon points="248,100 237,92 237,108" class="ah" />
    <rect x="250" y="76" width="130" height="48" rx="8" class="goldbox fm-pulse" />
    <DiagramIcon name="random" x={276} y={100} size={26} />
    <text x="298" y="105" class="b">select</text>
    <text x="400" y="105" class="body">
      <tspan data-lang-en>picks one ready case at random</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>chọn ngẫu nhiên một case đã sẵn sàng</tspan>
    </text>

    {rows.map((r) => (
      <>
        <text x="20" y={r.y + 18} class="body">{r.label}</text>
        <rect x="130" y={r.y} width={r.n * SCALE} height="26" class="goldbox" />
        <text x={130 + r.n * SCALE + 12} y={r.y + 18} class="b num">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{r.n} wins</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>thắng {r.n} lần</tspan>
        </text>
      </>
    ))}
    <text x="20" y="262" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Bar length is proportional to the wins. A run on your machine gives different counts, near 500 each.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Độ dài thanh tỷ lệ với số lần thắng. Máy bạn ra số khác, quanh 500 mỗi bên.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>select has no priority for the first case. When several cases are ready, the choice is random.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>select không ưu tiên case đầu. Khi nhiều case cùng sẵn sàng, lựa chọn là ngẫu nhiên.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp20b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp20b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp20b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp20b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp20b .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp20b .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp20b .body { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp20b .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp20b .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp20b .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp20b .goldbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp20b .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .gp20b .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp20b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
